{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:204","content":{"id":204,"title":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"85b899e0-7688-4795-bf04-40036bf1ae9c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞的分类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9b053aef-6b64-41b0-b69a-2432a71b9a1e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"50238a66-fa34-4053-9082-301a012ec5f0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1db3e7ab-e4d3-4ca6-bebd-305ba1780629","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助线 T 细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5f398dea-fd5f-4343-9f05-b61adeb4d37e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1eaadea1-7aa9-4b21-8c79-2fddb51a274e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"杀伤性 T 细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1857e07d-80c5-4594-81d2-86fb528db36e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c05869a7-0a64-44da-807b-db6081c0fe31","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调节性 T 细胞"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7acecf74-a4d8-4666-8f94-021b51811a03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一种还能特化成不同的亚类。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"947ccca7-86cb-4810-94d4-0bef982b31c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们指挥其他免疫细胞，并激活最重型的武器。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e993ec4-952b-4acd-ad7c-39986e3eee51.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e993ec4-952b-4acd-ad7c-39986e3eee51.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1bc1e8f2-b928-4712-9869-1a2e7a80b9d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fef8ed7c-a7dd-43c5-b3b0-7cb3f6aba970","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里只介绍辅助性 T 细胞。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e895f5e-4372-4b14-844e-6e48c385c904","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助性 T 细胞激活后，第一件事情就是克隆增殖自己，几小时内就有了几千个同样的活化辅助性 T 细胞。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"331bbb65-e823-4f87-97fb-0dfb45e1eb55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之后分为两组："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1f1003e3-11b0-49e6-8ec1-2545876828b2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"08623e31-422e-4401-8d72-76b4349305b5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8d292167-80b3-42e1-a2d5-67bedbcf2461","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"熟悉情况后奔赴战场，受伤 5-7 天后辅助性 T 细胞到达感染地点，指挥战斗，不亲自上阵杀敌，它能增强局部免疫细胞们的战力"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e02400d9-33b1-487d-92cb-71f14dc175cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"巨噬细胞体内有凋亡的定时器，辅助性 T 细胞可以一遍遍重置定时器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ca3123f-ad01-4bcb-a865-ad28d28c11d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"战斗结束后，让细胞们平静下来，最后大部分自我毁灭，小部分会变为记忆 T 细胞，下次遇到相同的敌人，识别速度比先天性免疫系统还要快得多"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c16bbdc1-3a57-4f11-9245-dfc472a42e53","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f34ab060-6130-4985-b9cc-8fd878ded4f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"激活【军工厂】的无敌 B 细胞"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:204","type":"doc","id":204}}],"prevPage":{"title":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}},"nextPage":{"title":"21 军工厂和狙击枪","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:205","type":"doc","id":205}},"createTime":1741564571440,"updateTime":1756124019984,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124019984}}